Piskie browser automation runtime

This product contains source-derived portions of chrome-devtools-mcp 1.7.0.
The adapted portions include page/session ownership, action waiting, snapshots,
input and dialog tools, file-root validation, console/network collectors,
formatters, filters, and pagination.

